From 4df48ee7efd2e4f73ffc1eafb16a27d600108bd6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ci7lus <7887955+ci7lus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] avformat/mmtp: expose MH service, event and TOT metadata

Parse MH-SDT, MH-EIT present/following, and MH-TOT signalling. Expose the selected service and present event through program metadata, publish MH-TOT as UTC epoch microseconds, validate BCD time fields, and notify consumers only when metadata actually changes.
---
 libavformat/mmtp.c | 323 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 314 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libavformat/mmtp.c b/libavformat/mmtp.c
index f9294bc931..a8d8c72766 100644
--- a/libavformat/mmtp.c
+++ b/libavformat/mmtp.c
